@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### 1st request: full 200 with an ETag
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/demo/etag?session=http-file

### Conditional request: should return 304 Not Modified
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/demo/etag?session=http-file
If-None-Match: "v1"

### Change the resource, then repeat the conditional request: now 200
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/session/http-file/change-resource

### What reached the server
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/session/http-file/log

###
